case simulizar_loadbalancer_scaleUp_high
driver simulizar.examples.loadbalancer
kind simulizar-rule
dir qvto-testkit/corpus/simulizar/loadbalancer
qvto scaleUp.qvto
in prm-high.xmi
in loadbalancer_on_iaas.allocation
conf target/pcm/pcm.conf
imports folder
source Palladio-Analyzer-SimuLizar/bundles/ExampleModels/org.palladiosimulator.simulizar.examples.loadbalancer/reconfigurations_qvto
note the rules assert fatal when no reconfiguration is required; severity as recorded
dump models
end

