case spd_minimalexample_main
driver slingshot.SpdAdjustmentBehavior
kind spd
dir qvto-testkit/corpus/spd
qvto transformations/spd/MainTransformation.qvto
in minimalexample/default.allocation
in minimalexample/default.system
in minimalexample/My.resourceenvironment
in minimalexample/default.repository
in minimalexample/default.spd
in minimalexample/default.semanticspd
in minimalexample/default.usagemodel
conf target/pcm/pcm.conf
imports root qvto-testkit/corpus/spd/transformations
config keepModeling=true
source Palladio-Addons-SPD-Metamodel/bundles/org.palladiosimulator.spd.semantic.transformations/transformations
note Slingshot binds the models by nsURI and sets keepModeling; the ProfilesLibrary blackbox is a stub (reference/runner/src-stubs)
dump models
check severity 0 0
end
